  <data key="d4">MechanismClaim</data>
  <data key="d5">Strong metal-support interaction at the Ru/W18O49 interface produces an electron-deficient Ru cluster state, modulates Ru–H strength, and, together with proton transport through W18O49, enables efficient bifunctional hydrogen electrocatalysis.</data>
