<node id="paper::broad_12549367c327c283ccf7::claim_pt_co085se_mechanism">
  <data key="d4">MechanismClaim</data>
  <data key="d5">Single-atom platinum in Pt/np-Co0.85Se optimizes the surface states of Co0.85Se active centers under realistic working conditions, reduces the energy barriers of water dissociation, and improves hydrogen adsorption/desorption behavior, thereby synergistically promoting hydrogen-evolution thermodynamics and kinetics.</data>
  <data key="d6">electrocatalytic_mechanism</data>
  <data key="d7">Single-atom platinum in Pt/np-Co0.85Se optimizes the surface states of Co0.85Se active centers under realistic working conditions, reduces the energy barriers of water dissociation, and improves hydrogen adsorption/desorption behavior, thereby synergistically promoting hydrogen-evolution thermodynamics and kinetics.</data>
  <data key="d8">mixed</data>
  <data key="d9">Mechanistic interpretation supported by operando X-ray absorption spectroscopy and density functional theory calculations.</data>
  <data key="d10">["claim_pt_co085se_mechanism"]</data>
  <data key="d11">1</data>
  <data key="d12">broad_mechanism_abstract</data>
  <data key="d13">broad_abstract_support</data>
  <data key="d14">True</data>
  <data key="d15">abstract</data>
